#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:27
#: 72e4e818de3d4fbaba42b75cb7e62ebe
msgid ""
"fa-py-libraries documents XRoboToolkit as “XRoboToolkit App + PC Service”"
" and WebXR as the browser path (`./run.sh vr` / `./run.sh vr-xrt`). Store"
" listings and ADB steps are in the headset and fa-py-libraries READMEs "
"when they document them."
msgstr "fa-py-libraries 把 XRoboToolkit 写成「XRoboToolkit App + PC Service」，把 WebXR 写成浏览器路径（`./run.sh vr` / `./run.sh vr-xrt`）。商店条目和 ADB 步骤以头显和 fa-py-libraries README 里写到的为准。"

